  "notable_quotes": [
    "Some reported MOF catalysts require high temperature, added organic solvents, complex preparation, or long 60 h runs at ambient CO2 pressure.",
    "The catalytic mechanism is proposed to rely on synergistic Lewis acid-base sites in Zn(PZDC)(ATZ) together with nucleophilic Bu4NBr under solvent-free conditions.",
    "Zn(PZDC)(ATZ)/Bu4NBr catalyzed solvent-free epoxide-CO2 coupling at 90 °C and 1 MPa in 6 h, giving propylene carbonate TON 131.0 and TOF 21.8 h−1."
